ond Olympic Oval, Minoru Park! (id:67604)"},"30239192":{"photos":["https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639242027507930000/reb89/highres/5/R3161835_1.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639242027507930000/reb89/highres/5/R3161835_2.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639242027507930000/reb89/highres/5/R3161835_3.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639242027507930000/reb89/highres/5/R3161835_4.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639242027507930000/reb89/highres/5/R3161835_5.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639242027507930000/reb89/highres/5/R3161835_6.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639242027507930000/reb89/highres/5/R3161835_7.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639242027507930000/reb89/highres/5/R3161835_8.jpg"],"remarks":"This luxury condo is designed to offer maximum comfort and style. 6 floor south facing allowing you and your family enjoy your family time along with beautiful view. With spacious layouts and modern finishes, 9´ celling and you have premium interior setup and state of art amenities. Our condo features fully equipped kitchen; gas range accented by beautiful granite kitchen countertop. Highly efficient head pump and air condition system to make your stay comfortable though the year. You'll have everything you need to feel right at home. Perfect unit for young family or professional reliant on public transit, offering the convenience and accessibility of living in the heart of city. (id:67604)"},"30309224":{"photos":["https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639256139067330000/reb89/highres/8/R3167978_1.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639256139067330000/reb89/highres/8/R3167978_2.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639256139067330000/reb89/highres/8/R3167978_3.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639256139067330000/reb89/highres/8/R3167978_4.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639256139067330000/reb89/highres/8/R3167978_5.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS63925613906733000