/highres/1/R3174381_20.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639272374918000000/reb89/highres/1/R3174381_21.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639272374918000000/reb89/highres/1/R3174381_22.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639272374918000000/reb89/highres/1/R3174381_24.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639272374918000000/reb89/highres/1/R3174381_25.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639272374918000000/reb89/highres/1/R3174381_26.jpg"],"remarks":"Newly renovated 5000 sqft waterfront executive home with beach access in Langdale on quiet treed acre.  Basement walkout floor with bar, TV and games room, gas fireplace, steam shower, pool table....walkout to outdoor shower and hottub, green house. Enjoy indoor/outdoor living and dining with expansive patio. Two living rooms and fireplaces (one wood burning fireplace, one gas),formal dining room. Master suite with luxury spa bathroom and walk in closet, 3 guest room rooms,  guest bathroom, 1000 sqft nanny suite including kitchenette. Path and stairs down to ocean and private beach access with additional bunkie sleeping house (set up as office with loft king bed) Discerning owners moving overseas looking for the right tenants to entrust their home for longer term arrangement. (id:67604)"},"30420152":{"photos":["https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639280259333370000/reb89/highres/7/R3176627_1.jpg"],"remarks":"Welcome to FORMAT by Cressey! Bright 1 bed + den, 1 bath home (561 sqft) on the 12th floor with southwest exposure and a private balcony. Features in-suite laundry, air conditioning and one secured parking stall with EV charger installed. Offered partially furnished (furniture removal negotiable). Building amenities include residents lounge, co-work space and rooftop terrace with BBQ. Available Nov 1, 2026 with a minimum 1-year lease at $2,400/month. No smoking, no pets. Rent includes internet. (id:67604)"},"30458744":{"photos":["https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639307922012770000/re